    "methodology": "Local Inference Lab llm-inference-bench v0.6.2 (commit ccd9ad8, SHA-256 053989ed...) with the flags of rtx6kpro/benchmarks/prepared-b12x-serving/ds41, run against the engine port. Prefill: standalone cold profile, unique prompts with exact /tokenize targeting, 30 s windows, input tokens divided by client TTFT. Decode: three passes of 30 s sustained cells after 15 s warmup at concurrency 1/2/4/8/16 and context 0/32k, temperature 1, EOS respected; rows are medians of the three passes; no errors and no loops in any cell. Two stress rows use random token ids (worst case for disk Engram reads). GPUs capped at 275 W, stock clocks, no P2P driver override, driver 595.84.",
